								<Text><![CDATA[""/*The default setting of "" here means that your base layout names are identical to their LayoutTableName.If, however, your BaseLayout names have the form "«prefix»«table_name»" - i.e. they are displayed as "«prefix»«LayoutTableName» («LayoutTableName»)".For example, if your (Base)Layout name is displayed as "I Service SomeTable (SomeTable)" then- Get( LayoutTableName ) of this layout is "SomeTable"  - fmIDE calls this the `table_name`- Get( LayoutName ) of this layout is "I Service SomeTable"   - fmIDE calls this here the `base_layout_name`- so the prefix to prepend is "I Service " (don't forget the space)Enter "I Service " here (and don't forget the space!) in order to- map `table_name` "SomeTable"- to `base_layout_name` "I Service SomeTable"*/]]></Text>
